{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {

  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {

  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {

  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 700,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, then let's kick it off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3840,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This talk is the evals that made GitHub\nCopilot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8020,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just to get things started,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11620,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we'll go through a quick intro so that you\nguys can know who you're talking to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17240,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My name is John Berryman. Very nice to\nmake all your acquaintance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21200,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I worked at GitHub starting in 2019,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27020,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but that was well before Copilot was a\nthing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29200,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so my first thing at GitHub was\nsearch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32740,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At that time, search was the world to me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36660,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Search is my hammer and the world is a\nnail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40280,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But over time, after"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44140,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I worked on the code search team, I moved\non to data science and then worked with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50120,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hamel there, actually. It's the first time\nwe got to meet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53240,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then from there, moved into Copilot\nbecause I had kind of a data background"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58740,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and an engineering background, so it was a\ngood fit for me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62280,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My projects while I was there was code\ncompletions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66140,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then after about six, seven months of\nthat, I moved into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71340,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the chat, but it was web chat, so it's not\nthe IDE chat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77800,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since then, about a year ago, I stepped\naway finally from GitHub to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83480,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "become an independent consultant,\nfollowing again in Hamel's footsteps."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88240,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I wrote a book that was published last\nNovember called Prompt Engineering for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93660,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "LLMs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94900,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Also, since he's given me the bully\npulpit, and Hamel, if you wouldn't mind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99280,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just posting a link from this, that would\nbe awesome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102260,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do have a Maven course coming up soon\nabout building LLM applications."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107300,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the idea is we're getting lots of\nbuzzwords and there's like a million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111840,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different ways that you can build all this\nstuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114520,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when you get right down to it, there's\na few underlying principles, and if you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118080,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "know them, you can rearrange them to make\nan amazing diversity of things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122500,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's kind of the... That."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126680,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sean, do you want to come in here? Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128660,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hi. I posted John's course in the chat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131760,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks, Hannah. Hi, I'm Sean Simister."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136940,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Worked at GitHub for three years, starting\njust after Copilot had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142880,
    "dDurationMs": 2932,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "come out in beta."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145812,
    "dDurationMs": 4612,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before that, I was at Google working on\nsome machine learning stuff,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150424,
    "dDurationMs": 5132,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some search engine stuff. And yeah, so at\nGitHub, I took over some of the offline"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155556,
    "dDurationMs": 5212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evaluation work, building out—we'll talk\nabout the frameworks that we were building"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160768,
    "dDurationMs": 3012,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out for offline evaluation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164600,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then I prototyped the first version of\nCopilot Chat, and that led to a whole"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169120,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bunch of new evaluation techniques as\nwell, and so I'll talk about that later."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173980,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, yeah, just recently I've been\nworking on some personal research"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178200,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "projects, explain prompt, ground rules,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181240,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just really enjoying building with LLMs\nand building developer tools."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187920,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And thank you for, John, for inviting me\nto reminisce about our times working on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192960,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GitHub Copilot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194600,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, this is really exciting. I mean,\nfrom my perspective, just, you know, I was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199120,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around when GitHub Copilot first started,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203920,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when it first—that effort first kicked\noff, I was pretty skeptical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207780,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, they just partnered with OpenAI,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211320,
    "dDurationMs": 5270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it seemed like, you know, the first\nproject they jumped into right away, there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216590,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was a whole, like, menu of different\nthings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218960,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One was, you know, code search, which I\nthought, okay, that one seems like you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222520,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could tackle it. You know, no one really\never has seen, like, a language model like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228100,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that before, the one that OpenAI privately\nshared with GitHub,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233080,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and You know, I was really skeptical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235300,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like the first version did not work well\nat all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238180,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was like barely functional, if that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 240780,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's really like because of the evals\nthat I saw the product improve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247120,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like you could see, like every other day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250700,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the engineers would make progress\nagainst the evals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253660,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255540,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, first it was like vibe-based\nevals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257900,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like the people on the GitHub team, we\nwould be using it and be like, okay, this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261760,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is cool. And after a certain point, like\nthe evals, you know, like we would be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267760,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "moving the metrics on evals. And after,\nyou know, that provided a lot of signal"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 271420,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into what wasn't and was working. And it\nseemed like it was really unlocked the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277060,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "product. So I think from my perspective,\nit's like very critical."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281520,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, but I don't know the whole story."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283040,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Y'all know the whole story because y'all\nhave been there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285460,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Y'all worked on it for quite a long time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287200,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So. We know the whole story up until the\npoint where we left, and it's a really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291180,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interesting story. So I guess let's just,\nlet's dive in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297080,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First off, obviously quick slide, but make\nsure we have a shared foundation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302700,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Copilot, you guys all know what it is,\nright?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304700,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, you type in some code and it\nautomatically completes stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310680,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think this is probably one of the most\ncommon completions that I got while"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315180,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "writing comments. It was always insulting\nmy work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318760,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was the first part that grabbed\neveryone's attention, but it wasn't the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 325320,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Both Sean and I worked on the code\ncompletions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329780,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Sean was actually one of the very\nfirst people to work on the chat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335720,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "component to it. And here you see kind of\na screenshot of how that's evolved into"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340740,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what it is today. And that's not the only\npart that there was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343800,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's, it's probably you're less\nfamiliar with it, but this is the part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348700,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I moved to after code completions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351780,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There is an online component that you\nstill have access today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355080,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's free to everyone, so you can\nask questions about your repo and stuff"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359060,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361920,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as Hamel was saying, evaluations were\nreally a core piece of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367840,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what made Copilot. And so let's dig into\nthat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373620,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, this kind of gets into how my own\nthinking has shaped since"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379180,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "working at Copilot. And I'm going to\nattend Hamel and Trey's course,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 385000,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I'm excited to be corrected. But this\nis the way I kind of mentally cut up the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390700,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evaluations that we were doing at GitHub."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392640,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the easy end of the spectrum, you have\nsomething that's like algorithmic, things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 397500,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you get to code completion, and it's\neasy to just, like, check, like an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401160,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equalities check for whatever you're\ntesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405560,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So does, you know, if I'm extracting\nstructured content from a particular"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411100,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "website, does this website lead to exactly\nthis output?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415720,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can have, you know, a bunch of\nthose as, like, tests that you use in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420720,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eval."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421880,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does the response structure adhere to\nJSON, and in particular the schema that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427700,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm looking at? Is the length of the\nresponse within limit, or does, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 432440,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe it goes, it's too verbose or\nsomething, or too pithy?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437940,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is the code all in backticks? Any of these\nthings are things that are just really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441840,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "easy to write a normal programming check\nfor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445880,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the other end of the spectrum, we have\nLLM as judge, which is hugely important"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451740,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because so much of the work that we're\ndoing is subjective in nature, and you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455940,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of need a human to do it, but humans\ndon't scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459800,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So LLM as judge is anything that is\nsubjective."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464500,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You ask, you know, what is a preference\nfor, you know, this completion versus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469820,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, the canned response?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 472480,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Am I hallucinating, or is my response, you\nknow, actually accurately using the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478100,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "context provided? Those type things, more\nsubjective things that you can't write an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482620,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "algorithm for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484460,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Copilot was at this kind of\ninteresting in-between"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488920,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that I've come to call verifiable\nevaluations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492760,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are things that it's like, it's\nalgorithmic in some respect, but it's not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497200,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just so easy as looking at the output."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500160,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's things like, I'm generating code and\nI want to make sure the code compiles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504880,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to make sure that the code passes\nunit tests."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508060,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe it's SQL, and I want to make sure\nthat, I don't care what query it writes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513820,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it needs to have the right answers\ncome back, so it can have some degree of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517560,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "freedom with that. So all these things,\nthe code completion, you can't immediately"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522780,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "look at it, but you can run it, evaluate\nit somehow in a way that's more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527780,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "complicated than just the algorithm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529620,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally, underlying everything is A/B\ntesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534500,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's nothing particularly special about\nthis for Copilot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540460,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it was just an important part of our\nhistory."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545640,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, so we're going to walk through\neach of these and tell you the piece of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549520,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the puzzle as it lived itself out at\nGitHub."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 554780,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the first thing was exactly what Hamel\nwas referring to a moment ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 558520,
    "dDurationMs": 5820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We called it Harnesslib. It was a\nverifiable code completion evaluation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 564740,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the idea was,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567900,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, we've got this magic box.\nCertainly it was magic at the time, that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573460,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will look at your code and write,\nhopefully, working code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578680,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So as we were working on making the\ncompletions better,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 584600,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pulling in more context data that was, you\nknow, we hoped would be helpful, we had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589020,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to test the changes before we go live with\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591800,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is an offline tool that we did for\nthis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595700,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it was one of the first things I was\nintroduced to when I started with Copilot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601580,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The idea is simple, but you got to admit,\nit's a really cool idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607420,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "First off, we would gather test samples."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611300,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here's the rundown of how that works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614720,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Basically, you grab, you know, we've got\nall the repos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 617820,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you grab a large set of open source\nrepos."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621480,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Specifically in our case, Python and\nJavaScript."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623700,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We had to narrow it down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626580,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You run their tests. That's basically why\nwe had to narrow it down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630340,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We could run Python and JavaScript tests\npretty easily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 632480,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You run their tests, and you keep the\nrepos where all the tests pass."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636920,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's kind of a funnel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638940,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of those, you use code coverage tools to\nassociate the functions with your unit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644080,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tests. You have to make sure that you're\nactually testing something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 647620,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then of those functions that had some\ncoverage,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653000,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we've kind of forgotten the exact\ncriteria, but basically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656320,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the candidate functions had to have one\nunit test, had to have at least some"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662180,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "percentage of its lines covered. It had to\nhave, you know, no more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667740,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than blah number of lines. Otherwise, you\nknow, it was too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671660,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hard of a task for, you know, early days\nCopilot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676880,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it needed a doc string. So we're\nlooking for something that is the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680880,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "function, function name, the signature,\nthe doc string, and the context around"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686840,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this piece of code. All those became\ncandidate tests for evaluation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692200,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then running it, you kind of see what\nwe would do."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694940,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We would grab some of these, one of these\ncandidate functions, kind of, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700280,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "melon baller scoop out the implementation\nof it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705260,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "generate the contents again, and run the\nunit test again."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709460,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if we do this across lots and lots of\nfunctions, across lots and lots of repos,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715540,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then we can start to get an idea of\ndirectionality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719440,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, as a baseline, we know what version\nX of Copilot did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 723880,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wouldn't succeed at all, and I forgot\nwhat it was up to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727700,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was like 40 or 50 percent. It wasn't\neven a huge number back then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731980,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we know that— Can you talk a little\nbit about,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734880,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I recall, y'all selected these repos to\nbe like, you know, you had a way of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740160,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "selecting or filtering ones for, like,\nhigher quality and stuff like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743720,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you talk a little bit about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747060,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that? Maybe I touch on it a little bit in\nthis lessons learned thing right here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752680,
    "dDurationMs": 1940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Sean's going to cut in here in a\nsecond."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754820,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, we got these cute little pictures,\nand he can probably address that a little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759320,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bit too if I miss any points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762820,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, you know, as far as quality is\nconcerned, that was one of the things that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766320,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was kind of a lesson learned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770960,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We had to make sure that the content\nitself wasn't trained into the model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775220,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We would get these models from OpenAI, and\nguess what they were training the models"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779120,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on? All the code at GitHub. So when we had\nclose"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785020,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "relations early on with OpenAI, because we\nwere one of their first main customers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790840,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we could get a list of what went into the\ntraining and make sure that we had"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794800,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something that was trained after that\ndate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799080,
    "dDurationMs": 4980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's also important to make sure that your\nrepos are consistent with the traffic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804060,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you expect in production. And I think\nwe never quite—I mean, it was always very"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809340,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "subjective of this, but I think we always\nknew that we wished"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815340,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was a little bit more consistent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817720,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of the models—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820020,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because they weren't in the training set\nwere the newer models—sorry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 823860,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some of the code bases that weren't in the\ntraining data were newer code bases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 828420,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And guess what? Newer code bases tend to\nbe smaller, tend to be a certain type of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833020,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thing. And so, like, a lot of our code\nbases were a little bit smaller"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 836600,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than what, you know, you see worked on in\nproduction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840500,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's really interesting about the\nrelationship with OpenAI."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 844040,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You mentioned,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845460,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, in the beginning it seemed really\nclose."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847860,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like every week there was calls with Greg\nBrockman and Ilya, I remember."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853660,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'd get on conference calls with just them\nand a few other people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 857440,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It seemed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858800,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like super close. So it didn't stay that\nway?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861240,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't like that necessarily throughout\nthe entire time?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865280,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, it's interesting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866900,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by the way, Sean, you feel free to cut\nin here at any point that you want."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871420,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You had an earlier window than I did, even\nthough we were working at GitHub at the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874840,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "same time, but you were in the middle of\nit at that point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878920,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sean got to see about a year before I did,\nand then I think both me and Sean left"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884560,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at about a similar time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 887400,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "middle of last year. So yeah, at some\npoint,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892860,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we were the big"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895160,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kid in the kiddie pool. But eventually,\nyou know, ChatGPT landed, and it was very"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900220,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "important for them to do the best thing\nfor their own product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 906560,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe a couple—we've got a lot of ground\nto cover, so maybe just a couple more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910840,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tidbits here,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 912580,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then we've got the three other types\nof evals to go through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920340,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But a lesson that I think I learned, and\nthe reason I've got our pictures here is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924580,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because Sean almost learned the opposite\nlesson, and he makes a really great point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 929040,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I always felt like our test harness\nshould have been more—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933560,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Should have basically been a headless VS\nCode, so we could absolutely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939160,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "test every single component of our\ncodebase as it changed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944600,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I still agree with myself. That ends\nup being really good for, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948240,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "integration tests to make sure that you're\nkeeping the evaluations high."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955040,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now, maybe Sean, you can pop in here,\nbut I liked the points that you're making"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959720,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about the flexibility of the harness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964500,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, yeah. Just there was this kind of\nthese different phases of product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 969400,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "development where, you know, sometimes\nyou've got a new model with new"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973260,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "capabilities coming out, and you're trying\nto imagine, like, oh, how would people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976480,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "use this? And how can we evaluate\nsomething that people have not even had a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981540,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "chance to try yet? And so in that sense,\nyou can't just wrap the existing product"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987220,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in an evaluation harness and have that be\nthe only way to test things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990840,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do need this more experimental system\nwhere you can kind of prototype out new"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996720,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ways of using the AI, new ways of using\nthe product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000860,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then those are always less reliable,\nand so once you launch that, you kind of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004760,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have to go back into making it more\nreliable, more easy to evaluate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1013880,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that covers Harnesslib."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017560,
    "dDurationMs": 5500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The next big chunk is, so Harnesslib was\nverifiable tests, and it was probably"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023060,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the biggest chunk of our evaluations, and\nalso definitely one of the coolest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029020,
    "dDurationMs": 4580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A/B testing is what we did whenever it was\ntime to ship our changes online."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034520,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The offline test that we had would, you\nknow, hopefully, you know, limit— Limit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1040220,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the exposure to, you know, shipping\nsomething that was surprisingly bad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045800,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think it did a good job of that and\nhelped us really flesh out what was going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1050180,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be a good product to ship. But once we\nfinally did ship it, we had to make sure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1054700,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the changes are appropriate,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1057980,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that, you know, we'll start our users on\nlike 10%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063460,
    "dDurationMs": 5860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the traffic and kind of ramp it up,\nkeep an eye on how the product is doing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069320,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and see if anything is changing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071980,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And a really important lesson for us came"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077820,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from basically how these things were set\nup."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080280,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We had just a very few key metrics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085260,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to the best of our memory, it's these\nthree items on the screen here:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1091640,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "completion acceptance rate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093700,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you know, a user gets the ghost text\non the screen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098340,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do they accept it or not? So how often do\nthey accept it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102420,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Characters retained. A lot of times,\nespecially for users like me, I would like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106660,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "mindlessly accept everything and then\nedit."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110000,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That was kind of the pattern that I used."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111440,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we also had to incorporate that type of\nuser, that type of use case into it and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116440,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make sure that, you know, people weren't\nzombie-like accepting everything and then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120460,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, not liking any of it and having\nto, you know, go back and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126260,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "change it. And the last thing is kind of\nan obvious one, is latency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129840,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we come out with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132140,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a recommended piece of code that is too\nlate, then it's just bad for everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1138700,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, beyond the key metrics, we had\nseveral guardrail metrics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1142860,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by several, I mean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145580,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I tens, maybe even into low in the\nhundred."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149240,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there were a few of these were like\nvariations of these things above, like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154020,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "characters retained after a certain number\nof minutes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1156700,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, you know, anything that would give us\na way of kind of measuring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161700,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how How much it changed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165620,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to see if there's anything weird going on\nin the side."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171520,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I have a question about guardrails."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173120,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, a lot of times, guardrails, people\nhave guardrails, they're like binary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1177680,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pass-fails, like really catastrophic\nerrors or something they want to, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1182900,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prevent against."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184620,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was there some of that too, something like\nthat too, or was it mostly like these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188940,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "metrics you keep an eye on with the, like,\ndrifting wildly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193480,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, mostly we were looking at the key\nmetrics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195880,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That made the conversations really easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198900,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just so we would focus on just those few\nsimple things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1204000,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Guardrails, we didn't have, like, just a\nhard fail if something went wrong with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207880,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "them. They were part of the conversation\nif something was really going wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212760,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or, you know, if we were trying to\nunderstand the metrics, the guardrails"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216400,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were just a useful side conversation to\ndiagnose and figure out what was going on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222380,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the key metrics. So it all kind of\nfed back into that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1225240,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When, in the cases where, like, let's say\nthose key metrics, like acceptance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1230940,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rate, latency, everything were, like,\nimproving, let's say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1235200,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then the other metrics were sort of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1238760,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going astray, did that ever happen? And,\nlike, did you do a bunch of analysis, like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1243760,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "data science-y type of work to, like,\nfigure out why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1247360,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how was that conversation, like,\nsurfaced, let's say?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253220,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So stuff like that would happen\noccasionally."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1256460,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, you know, I'm going to be super fuzzy\non this because I wasn't really in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1261140,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "middle of this discussion. But we did\nhave, like, weird"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1266560,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "coupling in several of the metrics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269780,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the second bullet here: weird\ntrade-offs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1271940,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, like, sometimes you would maximize one\nof the metrics, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1277160,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would just tank another metric, and\nyou'd have to think really hard about why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281760,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those two were trading off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1284680,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, you know, if you really optimize for\nacceptance rates, well, one silly thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1289780,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would happen is, like, you have a\nbunch of little tiny completions, and so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1293100,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the experience was garbage when that\nhappened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1296560,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you'd have to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1298320,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really dig around in some of the other\nmetrics to figure out, you know, why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1303900,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a sudden departure happened from whatever\nyour baseline was."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1309560,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did that process, that detective work\nhappen?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1313220,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Was it like a lot of data science-y type\nof work where you're kind of doing a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317300,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of data exploration or, you know, like,\nyeah, how did it—who did that kind of,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1322700,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, detective work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1325640,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did that work? Yeah. So as part of,\nlike, these"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331520,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A/B experiments, you know, we would ship\nout new models, new prompt crafting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337480,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "techniques, and then, you know, we would\nhope to see, you know, the key metrics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1341600,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going up. But then sometimes we would see\nsomething like a guardrail metric, like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1346840,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "number of lines generated, you know,\naverage number of lines generated would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1350400,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jump in some weird direction, either up or\ndown, could be kind of alarming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356060,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so then there were different scales of\nthat, is like, you know, we'd have the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1359920,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "prompt engineering folks in the meeting\nand they might say, Oh yeah, we, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1364360,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we expect that because we improved the\nprompt in this way and it's giving more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368720,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "targeted suggestions, so it's actually\nokay if the number of lines goes down"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372120,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because they're higher quality lines."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1375080,
    "dDurationMs": 4660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, like you said, there are other\ntimes where everyone's like, We don't know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1379740,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why the number of lines have gone up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381500,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383080,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "concerning enough that it's worth, you\nknow, delaying the launch for a week while"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1386840,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "someone digs into the logs and actually\nfigures out what's going on, and then it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390780,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "becomes a data science"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1392540,
    "dDurationMs": 4900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "project. And so luckily, yeah, we had a\nwhole bunch of people on the Copilot evals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1397440,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "team that had that skill set who could\nkind of go off and dig through the data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400720,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and figure out what was going on, come\nback the next week for ship room and say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1404840,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All right, we looked at it. It's okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406400,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here's why. Let's move forward. Hey, Sean,\nyou're"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1412360,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doing the talking right now. I think this\nis one of the most interesting parts, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415500,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you were right in the middle of this\nLLM-as-judge stuff."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1419400,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you want to take this next section?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1421120,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just tell me when to progress the slides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423980,
    "dDurationMs": 5940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah. Yeah, so, yeah, like we felt we had\na really, really"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429920,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "good system with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432820,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this offline Harnesslib eval where we\ncould run different prompt crafting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1435500,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experiments or, you know, fine-tune models\nand see how that affects the product in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1440860,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an offline setting. And then we could also\nkind of ground that in online A/B"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1444860,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "experiments and make sure that, you know,\nthe changes actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450740,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "played out the way that we expected with\nour real user base."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1455320,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we were feeling pretty good about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457420,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then ChatGPT came out, and it kind of\nchanged how we thought about"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1463320,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evals. And I think it was obvious from the\nbeginning that these chat models were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467880,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "going to be a big deal, but we didn't\nquite realize at the time, you know, how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1473360,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474840,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was going to change our evals."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1476980,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, yeah, this is how we kind of\nbacked our way into LLM-as-judge, I guess,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483240,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and kind of started looking more at, like,\nsubjective quality judgments instead"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489000,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of these purely kind of execution-based,\nyou know, does the code work or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1494720,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not, which was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497120,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of one of the key ingredients to\ngetting the Copilot completion product to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501960,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1505460,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So at first—yeah, thank you, John—at\nfirst, I think when we looked at what"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1510840,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people were doing with ChatGPT and, like,\nkind of conversational programming, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1514260,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think we were calling it at the time, it\nkind of looked like what we were already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1519200,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doing with Copilot. You know, people would\nask it, you know, make this code cleaner"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1523980,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or, you know, write some unit tests for me\nor help me fix this bug, and then it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1528620,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would, you know, go through multiple steps\nof the conversation, but there'd still be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532480,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some code output."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534580,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I— I started building out the first\nversion of Copilot Chat and thinking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1539020,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about how I would evaluate that so we\ncould launch something eventually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1543900,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I started to realize, like, even\nthough there was code coming out of chat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549680,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what we needed to evaluate wasn't just the\ncode that was coming out of chat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552820,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What we needed to evaluate was the actual\nconversation, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556440,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And people obviously cared about getting\ngood code that came out, but they also"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1560980,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wanted to feel like the conversation was\nproductive, like the assistant was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1564840,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "listening to them and giving them good\nfeedback and that sort of thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1568540,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569840,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, we also had use cases in chat\nwhere there wasn't code coming out, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1573780,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So someone would say, like, Explain to me\nhow this code works, or like, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1578340,
    "dDurationMs": 3380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why is it using this API and not that API?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1582140,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And those are really helpful answers, but\nthere's no code that we can run."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1586080,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I started to think, like, maybe the\nonly way to evaluate these is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1592040,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just to have, like, side-by-sides, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1594020,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, you have your baseline, like, here's\nhow ChatGPT handles it, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1599860,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then here's how our agent handles it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1602520,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which one is better? And you just put it\nin front of a human and you ask them to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1606440,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, to rate, you know, which one is\nbetter, which one is worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1609520,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But obviously that's slow and it's\nexpensive to, you know, hire people and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1614160,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get a lot of those kind of judgments."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1617800,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you have to come up with a lot of\nguidelines too to help people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1621160,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can't just say which one is better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1622560,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have to explain what better means, and\nthey kind of read through and judge which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1626840,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "parts of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1629300,
    "dDurationMs": 5700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, so I set up a basic version of\nthat in Label Studio so I could just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635000,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of test the flow, and I found it\ndifficult just to say which one was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1639780,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640980,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I tried to make my life easier by\npassing it into GPT-4 and saying, okay,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1645660,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "here's my grading criteria. Tell me which\none you think is better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1649900,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then now I can just click through in\nLabel Studio and kind of judge the judge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1654640,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and say, you know, did GPT-4 make the\nright call on which one is better or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1659160,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "worse?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1660560,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even that was challenging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1666020,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, this was years ago when models\nweren't as good at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1671800,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "following the system instructions. And so\nsometimes it would get distracted and it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1677060,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would say, you know, the code on this\nconversation is more maintainable because,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1681920,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, they put their braces on a new\nline, whereas this one, the braces are on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685960,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the same line, so someone would have to go\nin and adjust that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1689200,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I was like, no, that's not what I'm\nevaluating at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692920,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, I'm trying to ask, like, did it\nwrite better unit tests?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1696980,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so I started going in and actually\njust writing out in, like, bullet points"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703580,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "explicitly what I wanted it to evaluate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1706020,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, does it have a test for, you know,\npassing in null values?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1709500,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Does it have a test for passing in an\nempty list?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1713740,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And finally that got to the point where I\ncould use this LLM as judge, and it would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1719220,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stick to my, you know, very granular list\nof things that I wanted it to evaluate on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1724940,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and give me good results. And I could kind\nof click through quickly and double-check"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1729020,
    "dDurationMs": 5560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these. And then once I verified that it\nworked for one model, then that could kind"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1734580,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of become the baseline, and I would only\nhave to compare the new conversation to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1738580,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "see if it matched the baseline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1741280,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that was kind of how we backed our way\ninto this LLM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747120,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as judge. It wasn't something that we\ndecided that we needed at the beginning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1750280,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was more just kind of realizing that\nHarnesslib wasn't going to be able to give"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753580,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "us What we needed, because Copilot Chat\nwas, in fact, like a whole new product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1759560,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't just the obvious next step for\ncode completion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1765060,
    "dDurationMs": 5840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, were you able to measure, like,\nsomehow the alignment between the judge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1770900,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yourself or other people? Like, how\ndid you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1775960,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go about instilling trust in the judge?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1781400,
    "dDurationMs": 5380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I would have loved to have done a much, a\nmuch more extensive study"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786780,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "proving that our judgments were being\naligned with the judge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1793180,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a crazy time to be working on AI,\nand everyone was shipping chat products"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1798960,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as quickly as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1801460,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1803040,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yeah, the first version of Copilot Chat\nwent out with basically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807900,
    "dDurationMs": 5780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our gut feelings of, you know, here's what\nwe think users"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1813680,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will do with this product, and here is an\noffline data set that kind of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819440,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "models that gut instinct."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1822840,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, you know, once we launch it,\nthen we can actually start to collect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1826620,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "telemetry and see how users are using it\nand then adjust our offline benchmarks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1830840,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the first version was really just like\na bet on how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1836720,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we thought this conversational programming\nwould evolve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1841200,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So on balance, like, would you say the\njudge was helpful, like more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1847080,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "helpful than wrong? Like, you were able to\nsee the outputs of the judge and find,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1852360,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, use cases, find examples you\nneeded to work on or correct things in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1857760,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, in the product?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1859780,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, absolutely. So once, once we kind of\nmade the, the adjustment to like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1865500,
    "dDurationMs": 4292,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "micromanaging the judge, where we're\nsaying like, you know, is there a test for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869792,
    "dDurationMs": 2412,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "this? Is there a test for that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1872204,
    "dDurationMs": 4412,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is there a test for that? Or like, does\nthe, does the answer mention that you have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1876616,
    "dDurationMs": 4252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do this? Does the answer refer to this\nspecific, you know, part of the API?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1880868,
    "dDurationMs": 4332,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then it, it was much more reliable. And I\nthink that that helped people get over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1885200,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also this, this weirdness with LLM as\njudge, where it's like, OK, you're asking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1889340,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the LLM to write some code for you, and\nthen you're asking the same LLM or like a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1893300,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "slightly different LLM whether it did a\ngood job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1895900,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, isn't it always just going to say,\nyeah, I did a great job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1899400,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the, the intuition here is that like\nthe generative task of starting from, you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1903760,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "know, the user's question and actually\nsolving it is a much harder task than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1908300,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "giving it this really like detailed list\nof requirements and then just getting it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1911860,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to check each one off. So once we got to\nthat point, yeah, we were pretty confident"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1915580,
    "dDurationMs": 5420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it was giving us good results. I\nmean, obviously there's still sometimes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1921000,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be hallucinations where, you know,\nyou ask it to check a box off on the list"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1924220,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it adds three more items to the list,\nyou know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1926360,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think people always like to ask, OK,\nwhen you're doing all this work on the LLM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1930320,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a judge prompt, did anything from that\nprompt make it over into the, that the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1935920,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "code completion model? Or, you know, did\nyou end up prompting another model with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941080,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "elements from the rubric of the judge?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1943760,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Did you end up, you know, making the main\nprompt more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1948380,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "specific based upon like, you know, yeah,\nlike just curious, like did it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1954300,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of feed into each other at all?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1958380,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe didn't prompt the model. Maybe it\nwas just like a code completion model that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1963020,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was just, you know, but I'm just curious\nif there's anything like that going on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1966820,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't remember any specific cases where\nit did."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1970360,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, like I said, we were much more\nfamiliar and confident with how we were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1975460,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evaluating the code completion product at\nthat point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1978360,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so much of the Copilot autocomplete\nwas like, can we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1984260,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get the right context in the prompt?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1986620,
    "dDurationMs": 5620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, and we were also fine-tuning\nmodels, but it wasn't like crafting the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1992240,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right system prompts the same way we were\ndoing with Copilot Chat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1997680,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know that we had done a number of\nexperiments with writing unit tests in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2002880,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Copilot completion, and then we did, you\nknow, other experiments in chat with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2007680,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "writing unit tests. But I don't think one\nended up feeding into the other."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2012580,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It ended up just mostly happening in chat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2017200,
    "dDurationMs": 5020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But one of the interesting lessons that we\nlearned coming out of this was, or that I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2022220,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "learned personally building this, was that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2027060,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there ended up being these two very\ndifferent personas on the team for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2031260,
    "dDurationMs": 5980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "evaluation. There were folks who, you\nknow, were trying to ship things, were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2037240,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trying to keep things from breaking, were\ntrying to prevent regressions, and they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2041740,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would come in and they would want to run\nthe eval."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2044680,
    "dDurationMs": 5350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so we would have to have, you know,\nreally clean, reliable ways to run the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2050030,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eval, get a number out, compare it to the\nprevious number, and make a shipping"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2053600,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decision. And at the same time, there were\na whole bunch of folks who wanted to pull"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2057680,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything apart into Lego blocks and\nreconfigure them and say, what if the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2060720,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "product worked this way? What if we use\nthis model?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2063280,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if we did that? And so it was much\nmore experimental and trying new things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2067880,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that hadn't been built before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2070740,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, yeah, it wasn't always clear that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2076000,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That should be all one eval pipeline."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2078420,
    "dDurationMs": 5180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think over time, we developed more\nand more evaluation tools, evaluation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2083600,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pipelines, and it felt a little bit\noverwhelming to some people to have more"
    } ]
  }, {
