  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2545700,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can see how often they— Yeah, it's\nreally important, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2548740,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because if you're— that's just a very\nsimilar task."
