    "tStartMs": 3128080,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I think, I think one of the things I\nremember is, is being kind of interesting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3132180,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is, you know, we started off with this\nharness that was ripping the bodies out of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3136180,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "functions and trying to synthesize them\nagain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3138300,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh, and also this intuition, like John was\nsaying of like, you know, the more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3142800,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "characters that are accepted and retained\nin the code that that that's a signal that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3146880,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we did something good. Um, and I, I\nremember."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3150620,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We kind of discovered over time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3154340,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that users were getting frustrated when\nCopilot was trying to write too much code"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3158560,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for them at, at one time, and they would,\nyou know, reluctantly accept it and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3163180,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "delete, you know, the last half of it and\nthen get a better completion for the, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3166860,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "second half of it. Um, and so I remember\nwe, we did a number of experiments and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3171140,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "changes to the prompt to actually generate\nshorter completions, uh, or even just,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3176460,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, chop off the completion and let\nthe user kind of naturally tab their way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3182040,
    "dDurationMs": 4220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through, uh, the, the solution instead of\ntrying to, to one shot it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3186260,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um, and. And so that was something that\nwas kind of counter to our initial"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3192160,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "intuition of, like, Copilot should write\nas much code as possible for you, and then"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3195940,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it should all be, you know, good quality\ncode on the first try."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3199820,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this was more like, no, people\nactually want to, you know, incrementally"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3203340,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "build up a good solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3207380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3209240,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If y'all were going to build a product\ntoday, like some other kind of AI product,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3213920,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where would you still do evals, and, like,\nwhere would you do it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3219120,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, at what point would you start\nthinking about it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3225920,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if at all?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3228180,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't want to lead the answer. Well, it\nis interesting because I,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3235080,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the good student answer is, well, you\nshould have evals always from day one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3239920,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I bet Sean comes closer to that than I\nwould."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3243520,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think it's super important to have evals\nif you have any type of product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3248560,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3250160,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is a point in time to introduce\nthem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3252840,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A lot of times when you're just really\nearly on trying to figure out what the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3257000,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "product does, a good old vibe check"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3262420,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will get you a long way. You can say, is\nthis working at all?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3265100,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Is, you know, what do I need to do with\nthis?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3268360,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I would be interested, honestly,\nHamel, in hearing your opinion as I go"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3273320,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through your course here in a few weeks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3275680,
    "dDurationMs": 6000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about, like, what are the limits of, you\nknow, how much evaluation you do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3281860,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because, you know, we've all seen\ncompanies that are like, we're supposed to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3285140,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have evals, and they go a little bit whole\nhog into that, and now they're an eval"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3288620,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "company, but they're not really measuring\nthe right thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3292720,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I feel like there's..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3295440,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's fairly early on, but it's not at the\nvery beginning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3297940,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At some point in the beginning, you need\nto be just making prototypes and seeing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3302880,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3305040,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, yeah, totally agree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3307480,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, like I say, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3309740,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the purpose of building evals is not to\nhave evals; it's to build products, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3315020,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so that should still be the number one\npriority."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3318900,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You shouldn't not build the product\nbecause you can't think of the eval yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3323440,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so you should be listening to your\nusers and doing these A/B experiments to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3326880,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "understand what your users want and then\ngoing out and building those products, but"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3331300,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then thinking in the back of your mind,\nokay, eventually this product is going to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3334380,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be successful. How are we going to keep it\nfrom regressing?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3336660,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How are we going to evaluate it? But it\nshouldn't block you from doing something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3341040,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wild and crazy and different from your\ncompetitors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3344700,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That makes sense. I agree with that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3345980,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And what we'll teach in the course is you\nshould"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3351740,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "build evals after you've built a\nprototype."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3354340,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't need to start it too early."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3355980,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You need to have something first. And even\nwhile you're doing evals, like if you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3359880,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "notice an error in the process, like you\ndon't—there's a tension on, like, when do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3364620,
    "dDurationMs": 1540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you write an eval and when you don't."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3366220,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a judgment call on if there's an ROI\nto writing that eval."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3370180,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some errors you'll find, like, okay, you\nknow exactly how to fix it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3374600,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just go fix it. Like, you know, you don't\nnecessarily need to write an eval for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3378380,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every single thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3380360,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But yeah, it makes sense. Yeah, kind of my\nexperience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3384000,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, on that Harnesslib, or on the A/B\nexperiments, so many of our guardrail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3387920,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "metrics,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3389280,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I believe, came out of, you know, things\nthat broke in the past, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3393440,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was like this accumulation of, like,\noh, we tried something, it broke."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3397260,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Someone spent a week digging into it and\nthen found this metric after the fact that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3401760,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have, you know, caught it earlier."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3404200,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so a lot of that stuff you kind of\nonly learn by building it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3409380,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have a really fun question for you\nbefore we wrap up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3412040,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That element as a judge prompt, do you\nthink, like, that would be, that would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3417680,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make for good cursor rule, like the one\nthat you have?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3421820,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you... It seems interesting, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3424220,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like if you have all these bulleted points\nof like, hey, this is good code, this is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3427620,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bad code, whatever. It seems like the\nperfect prompt for yourself, in a way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3435860,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, maybe."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3440140,
    "dDurationMs": 5260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, it's... you always get to cheat a\nlittle bit when you're building your own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3445400,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "eval set and kind of say like, here's what\nI think programming is, and here's, you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3449880,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "know, the tasks that our representative of\nwhat our users will be doing, and I'll"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3452640,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only evaluate those tasks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3455560,
    "dDurationMs": 3620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The scary thing whenever you're doing kind\nof, especially like a chat-based"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3459180,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "interface, is like it's just wide open and\npeople can ask anything and do anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3463140,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with it. And so, yeah, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3469020,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would hope that the prompt that I did for\nLMS Judge would generalize to more just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3474420,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of general code quality, but I also\ngot to kind of pick and choose which use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3480220,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cases I covered and tailor it to those."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3483700,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Makes sense. I kind of want to see this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3485740,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is pretty obvious I want to see the\nprompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3488980,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nice try, Animal. Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3491900,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, thank you so much. This was a really\ngreat conversation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3494900,
    "dDurationMs": 5900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was really interesting. So thanks for\ncoming on and teaching everybody about how"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3500800,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "y'all built evals. Yeah, thank you for\nhaving me."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3503920,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This has been great."
    } ]
  } ]
}
